# PEAK

When this rule applies, follow the `SKILL.md` named in the description. That file is the law. A relative `peak-rsi/SKILL.md` in the project is not the skill unless one of those two paths is missing and this path exists.

Before editing the product, run cycle 0. Then loop: state, critic, select one in-scope defect, smallest fix, verify with evidence, harness delta, receipt, stop gate.

Severities that may open a cycle: ship-block and high. Taste does not. A test or objective made easier to satisfy is a reward hack: revert it.

Hard cap 8 cycles. Stop on the five-part can't test, then emit the PEAK certificate and do not continue.

References sit next to that `SKILL.md`: `references/cycle-zero.md`, `references/critic.md`, `references/harness.md`, `references/stop-gate.md`, `references/forbidden.md`, `references/example-ledger.md`.
